{'symbol': 'GPC', 'date': '2022-02-14 16:30:00', 'title': 'GENUINE PARTS COMPANY ANNOUNCES 66TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR OF INCREASED DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'ATLANTA, FEB. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GENUINE PARTS COMPANY (NYSE: GPC) ANNOUNCED TODAY A 10% INCREASE IN THE REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND FOR 2022.\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE COMPANY, AT ITS\xa0FEBRUARY 14, 2022\xa0BOARD MEETING, INCREASED THE CASH DIVIDEND PAYABLE TO AN ANNUAL RATE OF\xa0$3.58\xa0PER SHARE COMPARED WITH THE PREVIOUS DIVIDEND OF\xa0$3.26\xa0PER SHARE.'}